      "subject": "ברך...קללה תחשב",
      "rationale": "Berin i kamap tong — Hibru i pairapim tupela tok: gutpela tok i save stat, tasol we i wok long nois bikpela long moning, em i bagarapim nem bilong poro."
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "רעהו",
      "rationale": "רעהו i tok 'poro bilong en' — tok i pairapim tubel; 'nembra' i lek 'narapela man' tasol."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Man i givim gutpela tok long poro bilong en wantaim bikpela nois, long moning i go hap tru — em i olsem tong, ol i skelim long em.",
